# Vercel upload filter for repository-root deploys (`gova` via GitHub,
# `asol-submain` and `asol-sub2main` via CLI). Service-only folders use their own `.vercelignore`.
#
# Goal: ship only what `npm run build` needs for the hosted Next.js app. Native
# shells, most prose docs, local databases, and CI-only trees are rebuilt or
# generated on the build machine — they must not inflate CLI uploads (~70MB+).

# ── Build output and dependencies (installed remotely) ─────────────────────
.git/
.next/
**/.next/
.tmp-static-build/
apps/
tmp/
node_modules/
out/
coverage/
*.apk

# ── Capacitor native shells (web build uses packages/native-core only) ─────
# Root android/ and ios/ are store shells. packages/native-core/{android,ios}/
# stay available for architecture and native-core contract tests during build.
/android/
/ios/
/fastlane/

# ── Local browser profiles used to test signed-in flows by hand ───────────
# Gitignored, so normally absent. Listed anyway as a second, independent line
# of defence: 170MB of Chrome cache, Safe Browsing databases, and on-device ML
# models. Next traced it into the release-console function and pushed it past
# Vercel's 250MB limit, failing every production deploy of the main app. If it
# is ever committed again, it still must not reach a build machine.
test_profile/

# ── Documentation, CI, editor, and local tooling ───────────────────────────
# Keep only generated architecture references required by architecture:check.
# IMPORTANT: anchor this at repository root. An unanchored `docs/` also matches
# packages/architecture-core/src/docs/ and removes the docs generator itself.
/docs/*
!/docs/01-architecture/
/docs/01-architecture/*
!/docs/01-architecture/08-reference/
/docs/01-architecture/08-reference/*
!/docs/01-architecture/08-reference/capability-map.md
!/docs/01-architecture/08-reference/package-catalog.md
!/docs/01-architecture/08-reference/dependency-map.md
!/docs/01-architecture/08-reference/application-feature-catalog.md
.github/
.cursor/
.ssh_local/
.ssh_config
scripts/tests/

# ── Local-only data and secret archives ───────────────────────────────────
public/sync_data/
config/secret-archive-latest.zip.enc
config/secret-archive-latest.zip.enc.private-key.pem
config/secret-archive-public.pem

# ── Service deploy mirrors (regenerated by services:sync during build) ───
services/*/generated/
services/**/.next/
services/**/.vercel/

# ── Mobile release secrets (keep custom_notification.mp3 for build contracts) ─
assets/google-play/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
assets/google-play/google-services.json
assets/google-play/*.json
assets/google-play/*.jks

# ── Credentials and machine-local environment files ──────────────────────
.env*
!.env.example
.ota/
